---
// Component for the white background "What We Do" intro section on home page
---

<section class="bg-white py-24 relative overflow-hidden">
	<img
		src="/brand/lines-element.png"
		alt=""
		class="hidden md:block absolute -right-0 top-0 w-80 h-auto pointer-events-none select-none"
		aria-hidden="true"
	/>
	<img
		src="/brand/lines-element.png"
		alt=""
		class="hidden md:block absolute -left-20 bottom-10 w-80 h-auto rotate-180 pointer-events-none select-none"
		aria-hidden="true"
	/>
	<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 z-10">
		<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-black mb-12">
			At MGG, we understand that every event is unique, which is why our core focus is on creating custom technical and staging experiences to assist in bringing the <span class="text-[#black] relative inline-block">
				<img
					src="/brand/stripe-though.svg"
					alt=""
					class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-4 md:h-5 lg:h-6 object-contain"
					aria-hidden="true"
					style="z-index: 0;"
				/>
				<span class="relative z-10">vision</span>
			</span> to life.
		</h2>

		<div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
			<article class="border-2 border-brand-yellow bg-white p-6 rounded-lg">
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-black mb-3">Technical Supply</h3>
				<p class="text-black text-md leading-relaxed">
					MGG's inventory of audiovisual equipment, trucks, and generators provides comprehensive technical solutions for events of all scales.
				</p>
			</article>

			<article class="border-2 border-brand-yellow bg-white p-6 rounded-lg">
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-black mb-3">Technical Production + Design</h3>
				<p class="text-black text-md leading-relaxed">
					Our team of project managers and designers work together to create seamless technical experiences tailored to each event's unique requirements.
				</p>
			</article>

			<article class="border-2 border-brand-yellow bg-white p-6 rounded-lg">
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-black mb-3">Fabrication + Printing</h3>
				<p class="text-black text-md leading-relaxed">
					Custom design, quality printing, and fabrication services to bring your creative vision to life with precision and attention to detail.
				</p>
			</article>

			<article class="border-2 border-brand-yellow bg-white p-6 rounded-lg">
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-black mb-3">Structures + Staging</h3>
				<p class="text-black text-md leading-relaxed">
					Safe, certified structures and staging solutions that provide the foundation for memorable events, built to the highest safety standards.
				</p>
			</article>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

